 {r}←ensurePlugins
⍝ Break from Link. #.EWC is often Link-managed, so without this a plugin's
⍝ classes would be serialised into the EWC source tree.
 setDefaults

 :If 9≠⎕NC'PLUGINS'
     'PLUGINS'⎕NS''
     'PLUGINS.classes'⎕NS''
 :EndIf
 {}{0::⍬ ⋄ ⎕SE.Link.Break ⍵}'#.EWC.PLUGINS' ⍝ reports "Not linked" when already detached
 r←PLUGINS
